    "reasoning": "For q-12997, adding 16 gives (a+4)^2=64, so p=4, q=64, and p+q=68. Taking square roots gives a=-4±8, hence a=-12 or 4. For q-112457, subtracting 5 and adding 49 gives (t-7)^2=49, so p=-7, q=49, and pq=-343. The roots are 0 and 14, whose sum is 14. Both current selections agree with their own captured worked solutions; no submitted grade is supplied.",
